 your phone, cancel the month it stops earning its keep.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Priced openly — from ₹10,000/month</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">7-day free trial, no card</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Live the same week</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Cancel anytime</span></div></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14.5px] font-semibold px-[26px] py-[14px] rounded-full transition-colors bg-gold text-[#1A1208] hover:brightness-105\" href=\"#plans\">See the plans<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] px-6 md:px-[42px] pt-[44px] pb-11 bg-surface border border-gold/[0.28]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">The team</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-[30px] md:text-[34px] font-medium tracking-[-0.015em] mb-3.5\">We run it</h2><p class=\"font-body text-[15.5px] leading-[1.68] text-muted mb-8\">Strategy, content, production, campaigns and on-ground activation, handled end to end by our team — running on the same two agents.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 mb-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Scoped per engagement, quoted after a call</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Media spend and creator fees billed at actuals</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Monthly reporting against agreed targets</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-2\">Volumes agreed up front, in writing</span></div></div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14.5px] font-semibold px-[26px] py-[14px] rounded-full transition-colors border border-rule-2 text-ink-2 hover:border-gold hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/services\">Talk to us<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><div id=\"plans\"><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-[130px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[620px] mb-[62px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">Pricing</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[34px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.14] md:leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">Cheaper than the hire. <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Faster than the agency.</span></h2><p class=\"font-body text-[17px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\">A marketing executive costs ₹30,000–50,000 a month, plus tools, plus six weeks of interviews, plus the morning they hand in their notice. This starts working on Thursday.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden mb-[62px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9 pt-7 pb-5\"><div class=\"neb-label\">What you&#x27;d otherwise be paying for</div></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">A marketing hire</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹30,000–50,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">A designer for creatives</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹12,000–20,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Scheduling &amp; content tools</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹3,000–5,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">WhatsApp Business API / CRM</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹5,000–10,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Someone to answer leads fast</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">₹8,000–12,000/mo</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-4 border-t border-rule\"><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Weeks spent interviewing</span><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-muted text-right\">4–6 weeks, before they start</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 md:px-9 py-6 border-t border-rule-2 bg-surface-2\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[22px] font-medium\">Doing it yourself</span><span class=\"font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[22px] font-medium text-muted tabular-nums\">₹58,000–97,000+/mo</span></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9 pt-7 pb-5 border-t border-gold/[0.18] bg-gold/[0.05]\"><div class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold\">What you get instead</div></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-9 bg-gold/[0.05]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Strategy and ICP, built from your URL</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">A month of content planned and drafted</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Posts, carousels and AI reels</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Competitor tracking and counter-content</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">WhatsApp, email and SMS handled</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 py-3.5 border-t border-gold/[0.14]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-body text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Live on Thursday, not in six weeks</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 md:px-9 py-6 border-t border-gold/[0.18] bg-gold/[0.09]\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[22px] font-medium text-gold-text\">With Nebulaa</span><span class=\"font-heading text-[24px] md:text-[26px] font-medium text-gold-text tabular-nums\">From ₹10,000/mo</spa